        "Native American schools",
        "Phoenix Indian School",
        "September 2009 in Arizona",
        "Signs in Arizona",
        "Taken with Canon Digital IXUS 870 IS"
      ],
      "sourceType": "commons-category",
      "sourceArticleId": "heard-museum-wp",
